<code>assert (\result != -1) => (this.get(\result) == null) == (o == null);</code>

This assert statement ensures that if the `lastIndexOf` method does not return -1 (meaning the element was found), then the element at the returned index is null if and only if the searched object `o` is null.
--------------------
<code>assert (\result != -1 && this.get(\result) == null) => o == null;</code>
